# Running the study

`tvbo run <Study>.yaml` runs every experiment in dependency order (each `from_experiment`
source before its dependents). Add `--experiment <ids>` for a subset. Each writes a
native `<stem>_result.h5` (+ a `.yaml` provenance sidecar). Figures + report:
`python code/figures/plot.py && quarto render report/report.qmd --to pdf`.
